    "rendered": "<div class=\"xyz-content\">\n<nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" class=\"shell pt-6\">\n<ol class=\"m-0 flex list-none flex-wrap items-center gap-2 p-0 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\">\n<li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"> <a href=\"/\" class=\"no-underline hover:underline\"> Home </a> </li>\n<li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"> <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-rule\"> / </span> <a href=\"/services/\" class=\"no-underline hover:underline\"> Services </a> </li>\n<li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"> <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-rule\"> / </span> <span aria-current=\"page\">Trust + corporate trustee</span> </li>\n</ol>\n</nav>\n<div class=\"shell pt-6\">\n<p class=\"eyebrow m-0\">Bundle</p>\n<h1 class=\"mt-3 max-w-3xl text-3xl sm:text-4xl\">Trust + corporate trustee</h1>\n<p class=\"mt-4 max-w-2xl text-[1.0625rem]\">A discretionary family trust with a company as its trustee, set up together — so the trust&#8217;s assets sit apart from your personal ones and trustee changes later are a share transfer, not a re-papering of every asset.</p>\n</p></div>\n<section class=\"shell mt-10\">\n<div class=\"grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3\">\n<div class=\"card p-5\">\n<p class=\"eyebrow m-0\">Our fee</p>\n<p class=\"mt-1 mb-0\"> <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums tracking-tight text-ink text-2xl font-medium\">$869</span> <span class=\"ml-2 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\">fixed, inc. GST — saves $79 on company and trust setup bought separately</span> </p>\n<p class=\"mt-1 mb-0 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\">Fixed, agreed in writing, no work begins before you accept it.</p>\n</p></div>\n<div class=\"card p-5\">\n<p class=\"eyebrow m-0\">Government charges</p>\n<p class=\"mt-1 mb-0 text-[1.0625rem] font-semibold\">ASIC fee and any duty</p>\n<p class=\"mt-1 mb-0 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\">The company registration fee and any stamp duty on the deed, which depends on your state. Passed on at cost.</p>\n</p></div>\n<div class=\"card p-5\">\n<p class=\"eyebrow m-0\">Turnaround</p>\n<p class=\"mt-1 mb-0 text-[1.0625rem] font-semibold\">3–5 business days</p>\n<p class=\"mt-1 mb-0 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\">The trustee company is registered first, then the deed is prepared in its name and settled.</p>\n</p></div>\n</p></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"shell mt-16\">\n<div class=\"grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-[1.2fr_1fr]\">\n<div>\n<h2 class=\"text-2xl\">What&#8217;s in the bundle</h2>\n<ul class=\"mt-5 list-none border-t border-rule p-0\">\n<li class=\"border-b border-rule py-3 text-[0.9375rem]\">A trustee company registered with ASIC, set up as a special purpose company where that suits, for the reduced annual fee</li>\n<li class=\"border-b border-rule py-3 text-[0.9375rem]\">A discretionary trust deed naming the company as trustee</li>\n<li class=\"border-b border-rule py-3 text-[0.9375rem]\">Settlement of the trust and guidance on stamping the deed in your state</li>\n<li class=\"border-b border-rule py-3 text-[0.9375rem]\">ABN and TFN for the trust, and GST registration if it will trade</li>\n<li class=\"border-b border-rule py-3 text-[0.9375rem]\">Advice on beneficiaries, the appointor and resolving distributions by 30 June</li>\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<h2 class=\"text-2xl\">How it runs</h2>\n<ol class=\"mt-5 list-none border-t border-rule p-0\">\n<li class=\"flex gap-4 border-b border-rule py-3\"> <span class=\"font-mono text-[0.75rem] tabular-nums text-ink-soft\"> 01 </span> <span class=\"text-[0.9375rem]\">Verify identity online — each director, trustee or controlling owner does a three-minute check on their phone, included in the fee. Every client, every service, no exceptions. <a href=\"/identity-verification/\">How it works</a>.</span> </li>\n<li class=\"flex gap-4 border-b border-rule py-3\"> <span class=\"font-mono text-[0.75rem] tabular-nums text-ink-soft\"> 02 </span> <span class=\"text-[0.9375rem]\">Tell us who will be directors, the appointor and the family members to benefit.</span> </li>\n<li class=\"flex gap-4 border-b border-rule py-3\"> <span class=\"font-mono text-[0.75rem] tabular-nums text-ink-soft\"> 03 </span> <span class=\"text-[0.9375rem]\">We register the trustee company.</span> </li>\n<li class=\"flex gap-4 border-b border-rule py-3\"> <span class=\"font-mono text-[0.75rem] tabular-nums text-ink-soft\"> 04 </span> <span class=\"text-[0.9375rem]\">We prepare the deed in the company&#8217;s name for you to sign and settle in the portal.</span> </li>\n<li class=\"flex gap-4 border-b border-rule py-3\"> <span class=\"font-mono text-[0.75rem] tabular-nums text-ink-soft\"> 05 </span> <span class=\"text-[0.9375rem]\">We register the trust&#8217;s ABN and TFN and send you the full record.</span> </li>\n</ol></div>\n</p></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"shell mt-16\" id=\"start\">\n<h2 class=\"text-2xl\">Start it</h2>\n<p class=\"mt-2 mb-6 max-w-2xl text-[0.9375rem]\"> Tell us what you need and we will come back with a fixed fee and what we need from you. No obligation, and no charge for telling you that you don&#8217;t need this. </p>\n<div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3\"> <a href=\"/get-a-quote/\" class=\"btn\">Get a quote</a> <a href=\"/contact/\" class=\"btn btn-secondary\">Contact Us</a> </div>\n<p class=\"mt-3 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\"> Prefer to talk it through? Call 0407 179 179 and we will take the details over the phone. Please don&#8217;t include your tax file number either way — we ask for it securely once an accountant is working on your file. </p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"shell mt-12 mb-16\">\n<div class=\"card p-6\">\n<h2 class=\"text-lg\">Related services</h2>\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-3\"><a href=\"/services/trust-setup/\" class=\"btn btn-secondary text-sm\">Trust setup</a> <a href=\"/online-tax-returns/trust-tax-return/\" class=\"btn btn-secondary text-sm\">Trust tax return</a> <a href=\"/services/company-annual-compliance/\" class=\"btn btn-secondary text-sm\">Company annual compliance</a></div>\n</p></div>\n</section>\n</div>\n<div hidden class=\"xyz-schema\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Service\",\"@id\":\"https://superblyladyec52fb18e8-stxdq.wpcomstaging.com/services/trust-corporate-trustee/#service\",\"name\":\"Trust + corporate trustee\",\"url\":\"https://superblyladyec52fb18e8-stxdq.wpcomstaging.com/services/trust-corporate-trustee/\",\"description\":\"A discretionary family trust and a company trustee set up together, keeping trust assets apart from yours and later trustee changes simple. $869 fixed.\",\"provider\":{\"@id\":\"https://superblyladyec52fb18e8-stxdq.wpcomstaging.com/#organization\"},\"areaServed\":{\"@type\":\"Country\",\"name\":\"Australia\"}}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"@id\":\"https://superblyladyec52fb18e8-stxdq.wpcomstaging.com/#organization\",\"name\":\"XYZ Accounting\",\"url\":\"https://superblyladyec52fb18e8-stxdq.wpcomstaging.com/\"}</script></div>\n"
